msgid "A system update is ready. Restart the computer to finish installing it."
msgstr "Aleqqem n unagraw yewjed. Ales asenker n uselkim akken ad yemmed usebded-ines."

msgid "System files need repair. This happens automatically the next time the computer restarts."
msgstr "Ifuyla n unagraw ḥwaǧen ad ttwaseggmen. Ayagi ad yeḍru s wudem awurman tikkelt i d-iteddun ara yales usenker uselkim."

msgid "The web browser is not installed yet."
msgstr "Iminig web ur yettwasbedd ara yakan."

msgid "The web browser is ready. Sign out and sign in again to see it."
msgstr "Iminig web yewjed. Ffeɣ syen kcem tikkelt nniḍen akken ad t-twaliḍ."

msgid "This app is not available on this device"
msgstr "Asnas-agi ulac-it deg ibenk-agi"

msgid "This app's lock settings are not in effect, so it cannot start. Please ask your teacher."
msgstr "Iɣewwaren n usekkeṛ n usnas-agi ur teddun ara, ihi ur yezmir ara ad yekker. Ttxil-k, steqsi aselmad-ik."

msgid "Could not end your session. Please sign out and open this app from the sign-in screen."
msgstr "Ur yezmir ara ad yekfu tiɣimit-ik. Ttxil-k, ffeɣ syen ldi asnas-agi seg ugdil n tuqqna."

msgid "This will end your session and open %s in locked mode."
msgstr "Ayagi ad yekfu tiɣimit-ik u ad yeldi %s deg uskar yettwasekkṛen."

msgid "Newer settings could not be fetched. Please contact IT."
msgstr "Ur nezmir ara ad d-nawi iɣewwaren imaynuten. Ttxil-k, nermes IT."

msgid "Settings have not been confirmed up to date for %s days. Please connect to the network; if this persists, contact IT."
msgstr "Ɛeddan %s n wussan ur yettwasentem ara d akken iɣewwaren ttwaleqqmen. Ttxil-k, qqen ɣer uẓeṭṭa; ma ikemmel ayagi, nermes IT."

msgid "IT is collecting diagnostic info from this computer."
msgstr "IT la yesseggra talɣut n usenqed seg uselkim-agi."
